			"notes": "# 1.2.1 Relese!\nNote: I forget the recipe, so **please download** `Man-Mod-1.2.1-Fixed.jar`.\\\nAlright, if you don't want to change your mod list...you also can keep your version.\n## Important Information\nThe IDs of items `fystu_man:netherite_star_tea` and `fystu_man:netherite_star_ice_tea` were respectively changed to `fystu_man:nether_star_tea` and `fystu_man:nether_star_ice_tea` at mod version `1.2.1`.\\\nIf your save contains these two items, please **DO NOT** update this mod.\\\nIf you **really** want to update this mod, please **BACK IT UP** in case your items are lost.\n## Content Changes\n### Items\n- \\+ Golden Tea\n- \\+ Golden Ice Tea\n### Effects\n- \\+ The Rain Of Gold\n- \\+ Golden Touch\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/feiyangstudions/MinecraftManMod/commits/1.2.1"
